ld.</p></div><h4 class="plan-price">$197</h4><div class="pricing-list w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>Healthcare MVP templates</li><li>Build notes and implementation examples</li><li>Healthcare workflow prompts</li><li>Member updates and special access</li><li>Digital Health Collective context</li></ul></div></div><div class="pricing-bottom"><a data-w-id="ef2eb4bb-86b1-6375-1645-822bfbe8ce5b" href="/product/starter-plan" class="primary-button white w-inline-block"><div class="button-texts white-2"><div class="button-text _01 white-3">Start here</div><div class="button-text _02 white-4">Start here</div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id="ef2eb4bb-86b1-6375-1645-822bfbe8ce64" class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><div class="pricing-card _02"><div class="pricing-top"><div class="plan-info"><h3 class="plan-name dark">Healthcare Software Factory</h3><p class="plan-desp dark">For clinics, founders, podcast guests, and teams that need a working MVP and last-mile plan.</p></div><h4 class="plan-price dark">$3K+/quarter</h4><div class="plan-list w-richtext"><ul role="list"><li>MVP scoping and prototype build</li><li>Healthcare workflow customization</li><li>Integration and data boundary planning</li><li>Buyer, clinic, and operator handoff</li><li>Last-mile action plan</li></ul></div></div><div class="pricing-bottom"><a data-w-id="ef2eb4bb-86b1-6375-1645-822bfbe8ce6f" href="/product/growth-plan" class="primary-button base w-inline-block"><div class="button-texts"><div class="button-text _01">Start here</div><div class="button-text _02">Start here</div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src="/assets/cdn/69577d21-695e0d6115b7f2b425cd1eea_-.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Plan Ball" class="plan-ball _02"/><img src="/assets/cdn/69577d21-695e0d5edb23f2ae51f48d98_-1-.svg" loading="lazy" alt="Plan Ball" class="plan-ball left"/></div></div></section><section data-wf--faq-section--variant="base" class="section faq"><div class="container"><div class="wrapper faq"><div class="solutions-top pricing"><div data-w-id="7bed50f1-7faa-059a-dca0-e20b2bc9a8fa" class="cta-1 _01"><h2 class="solutions-text">Frequently</h2><h2 class="solutions-text asked">Asked</h2><h2 class="solutions-text">Questions</h2></div><p data-w-id="7bed50f1-7faa-059a-dca0-e20b2bc9a901" class="solution-para faq">Everything you need to know before starting your project with A+ Active.</p></div><div class="faq-wrapper"><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="5a1d76e7-60fe-4040-6ac2-624886b7b17a" class="faq-list w-dropdown"><div class="faq-question w-dropdown-toggle"><h3 class="faq-ques">What services does A+ Active provide?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-arrow"><path d="M15.0229 7.14779L9.39792 12.7728C9.34567 12.8251 9.28364 12.8666 9.21535 12.8949C9.14706 12.9232 9.07387 12.9378 8.99995 12.9378C8.92603 12.9378 8.85283 12.9232 8.78454 12.8949C8.71626 12.8666 8.65422 12.8251 8.60198 12.7728L2.97698 7.14779C2.87143 7.04225 2.81213 6.89909 2.81213 6.74982C2.81213 6.60056 2.87143 6.4574 2.97698 6.35186C3.08253 6.24631 3.22568 6.18701 3.37495 6.18701C3.52421 6.18701 3.66737 6.24631 3.77292 6.35186L8.99995 11.5796L14.227 6.35186C14.2792 6.29959 14.3413 6.25814 14.4096 6.22985C14.4779 6.20157 14.551 6.18701 14.6249 6.18701C14.6989 6.18701 14.772 6.20157 14.8403 6.22985C14.9086 6.25814 14.9707 6.29959 15.0229 6.35186C15.0752 6.40412 15.1166 6.46616 15.1449 6.53445C15.1732 6.60273 15.1878 6.67591 15.1878 6.74982C15.1878 6.82373 15.1732 6.89692 15.1449 6.9652C15.1166 7.03349 15.0752 7.09553 15.0229 7.14779Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><nav class="faq-answer w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-para">We offer AI practice audits, healthcare workflow design, documentation and front-desk automation, implementation planning, and retained optimization for private practices and healthcare operators.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="5a1d76e7-60fe-4040-6ac2-624886b7b17a" class="faq-list w-dropdown"><div class="faq-question w-dropdown-toggle"><h3 class="faq-ques">How long does a typical project take?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-arrow"><path d="M15.0229 7.14779L9.39792 12.7728C9.34567 12.8251 9.28364 12.8666 9.21535 12.8949C9.14706 12.9232 9.07387 12.9378 8.99995 12.9378C8.92603 12.9378 8.85283 12.9232 8.78454 12.8949C8.71626 12.8666 8.65422 12.8251 8.60198 12.7728L2.97698 7.14779C2.87143 7.04225 2.81213 6.89909 2.81213 6.74982C2.81213 6.60056 2.87143 6.4574 2.97698 6.35186C3.08253 6.24631 3.22568 6.18701 3.37495 6.18701C3.52421 6.18701 3.66737 6.24631 3.77292 6.35186L8.99995 11.5796L14.227 6.35186C14.2792 6.29959 14.3413 6.25814 14.4096 6.22985C14.4779 6.20157 14.551 6.18701 14.6249 6.18701C14.6989 6.18701 14.772 6.20157 14.8403 6.22985C14.9086 6.25814 14.9707 6.29959 15.0229 6.35186C15.0752 6.40412 15.1166 6.46616 15.1449 6.53445C15.1732 6.60273 15.1878 6.67591 15.1878 6.74982C15.1878 6.82373 15.1732 6.89692 15.1449 6.9652C15.1166 7.03349 15.0752 7.09553 15.0229 7.14779Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><nav class="faq-answer w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-para">A first audit can start after one masterclass or office-hour call. Retained implementation usually starts with a focused quarter so we can assess the workflow, configure the stack, train the team, and optimize what is working.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="5a1d76e7-60fe-4040-6ac2-624886b7b17a" class="faq-list w-dropdown"><div class="faq-question w-dropdown-toggle"><h3 class="faq-ques">Do you work with startups and small businesses?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-arrow"><path d="M15.0229 7.14779L9.39792 12.7728C9.34567 12.8251 9.28364 12.8666 9.21535 12.8949C9.14706 12.9232 9.07387 12.9378 8.99995 12.9378C8.92603 12.9378 8.85283