1166 6.46616 15.1449 6.53445C15.1732 6.60273 15.1878 6.67591 15.1878 6.74982C15.1878 6.82373 15.1732 6.89692 15.1449 6.9652C15.1166 7.03349 15.0752 7.09553 15.0229 7.14779Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><nav class="faq-answer w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-para">Yes. The work is designed as an audit and optimization loop: identify the workflow, test it safely, review the output, and adapt the system before it touches patients, payment, or records.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="5a1d76e7-60fe-4040-6ac2-624886b7b17a" class="faq-list w-dropdown"><div class="faq-question w-dropdown-toggle"><h3 class="faq-ques">What do you need to start a project?</h3><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" class="faq-arrow"><path d="M15.0229 7.14779L9.39792 12.7728C9.34567 12.8251 9.28364 12.8666 9.21535 12.8949C9.14706 12.9232 9.07387 12.9378 8.99995 12.9378C8.92603 12.9378 8.85283 12.9232 8.78454 12.8949C8.71626 12.8666 8.65422 12.8251 8.60198 12.7728L2.97698 7.14779C2.87143 7.04225 2.81213 6.89909 2.81213 6.74982C2.81213 6.60056 2.87143 6.4574 2.97698 6.35186C3.08253 6.24631 3.22568 6.18701 3.37495 6.18701C3.52421 6.18701 3.66737 6.24631 3.77292 6.35186L8.99995 11.5796L14.227 6.35186C14.2792 6.29959 14.3413 6.25814 14.4096 6.22985C14.4779 6.20157 14.551 6.18701 14.6249 6.18701C14.6989 6.18701 14.772 6.20157 14.8403 6.22985C14.9086 6.25814 14.9707 6.29959 15.0229 6.35186C15.0752 6.40412 15.1166 6.46616 15.1449 6.53445C15.1732 6.60273 15.1878 6.67591 15.1878 6.74982C15.1878 6.82373 15.1732 6.89692 15.1449 6.9652C15.1166 7.03349 15.0752 7.09553 15.0229 7.14779Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div><nav class="faq-answer w-dropdown-list"><p class="faq-para">To start, we need your practice type, current systems, top admin burdens, data boundaries, human approval rules, and the first workflow you want to test.</p></nav></div><div data-delay="0" data-hover="false" data-w-id="5a1d76e7-60fe-4040-6ac2-6